OL,3,AOfcom outlines age check methods ahead
OL,4,Aof social media ban for under-16s
OL,5,
OL,6,FA similar ban was introduced in
OL,7,FAustralia last year but many children
OL,8,Fthere have found ways to get round it.
OL,9,FThe UK says it intends to take a
OL,10,Ftougher approach.
